# Netlify redirect rules
# Location: repository root (same folder as index.html)
# The filename starts with an underscore and has no extension.
#
# Why this is here:
#   The site answers both at tijmenterkeurs.netlify.app and at
#   tijmenterkeurs.nl. To a search engine that looks like two sites
#   carrying identical content, and it has to guess which to show.
#   These rules send anyone arriving on the netlify.app address to
#   the real one.

https://tijmenterkeurs.netlify.app/*  https://www.tijmenterkeurs.nl/:splat  301!
http://tijmenterkeurs.netlify.app/*   https://www.tijmenterkeurs.nl/:splat  301!
